# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Throne — ignore rules
#
# Layout:
#   src/, include/, res/, cmake/   C++/Qt GUI
#   core/                          Go core (sing-box)
#   3rdparty/                      vendored code — TRACKED ON PURPOSE, do not ignore
#   script/, .github/              tooling and CI
#
# Build output lives in build/ and deployment/; both are ignored wholesale.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Build output ------------------------------------------------------------
/build/
/build-*/
/cmake-build-*/
/cmake-build_*/
/out/
/deployment/
/Throne
/Throne.exe
/Throne.app/
*.app/
/qtsdk/

# --- CMake -------------------------------------------------------------------
CMakeLists.txt.user*
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
CMakeUserPresets.json
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json
_deps/

# --- Compiled objects, libraries and binaries ---------------------------------
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.exp
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.ilk
*.idb
*.pdb
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.exe
*.gch
*.pch
*.res
*.manifest
*_pch.h.cpp
*_resource.rc
moc_*.cpp
moc_*.h
ui_*.h
qrc_*.cpp
*.moc
*.pro.user*

# script/FindProcDLL.dll is a build dependency of script/windows_installer.nsi
# and is tracked on purpose — keep it that way.
!script/FindProcDLL.dll

# --- Go ----------------------------------------------------------------------
go.work
go.work.sum
*.test
*.out
*.pprof
core/server/vendor/

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

